{
  "version": "1.1",
  "description": "Seed scenarios for retrieval end-to-end evaluation. Each scenario simulates a realistic gate failure and declares which categories/tags a human reviewer would expect the top-5 retrieved concerns to share. 'expected' lists are any-of (not all-of) — retrieval passes if at least one top-5 result shares at least one expected tag AND at least one shares an expected category. Scenarios curated 2026-04-23; add to this file (do not edit existing ones) when extending coverage. Augmented 2026-05-17 (H11) with H10 E1-derived fields: query_text, baseline_p5_e1, expected_relevant_tags, failure_codes_hint, known_weakness — these are additive and ignored by harness.py.",
